      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "第一次参加感觉怎么样？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "比我想的好。我最后还说了几分钟。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "而且大家都听得很认真。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我有两个词说错了，不过没有人觉得奇怪。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "正常聊天里谁都会说错。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "今天我真的感觉到了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "你还认识了别人吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "认识了两个人，交换了联系方式。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "很好，下次来就不会觉得陌生了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我发现新环境最难的是第一步。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，一旦开始，后面就容易多了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我以前总等自己准备得更好再参加。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "其实参加本身就是准备的一部分。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这句话很有道理。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "下个月还有一次类似的活动。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "如果时间合适，我还会来。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "到时候你可能已经认识一半的人了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc046_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "听起来不错，我开始期待了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
